  "credit": "LegendCraft — Archer Grapple hook arrow (model-specs/grapple-hook.md §14; concept concepts/archer/grapple/approved.png panel 1): the FLIGHT pose of the arc_grapple_hook prop rig, exported for the item-model route.",
